item.neko_hologram_projector.name=Neko Hologram Projector
item.neko_hologram_projector.tooltip.0=Right-click a multiblock controller to inspect its structure and configure a hologram.
item.neko_hologram_projector.tooltip.1=Shift-right-click opens the workbench; switch Structure and Blueprint on the left.
item.neko_hologram_projector.tooltip.2=Alt-right-click chooses a blueprint and reviews materials; Alt-right-click again locks the preview, then confirm in the workbench.
item.neko_hologram_projector.tooltip.3=Shift+Alt-right-click toggles area selection; left/right-click sets its corners, with Alt using your position.
item.neko_hologram_projector.tooltip.4=Ctrl-click selects multiple cells; Shift-drag selects a volume. Ctrl+X/C/V edits; RGB axes move blueprint cells.
