gtmb.hologram.help.3=Hologram shows the target; Current shows the world; Difference highlights changes.
gtmb.hologram.help.4=Green: satisfied; Blue: pending; Red: missing; Gold: protected; Purple: unsupported.
gtmb.hologram.help.5=Choose a position, then select blocks or hatches from inventory or material sources; placement does not prove formation.
